        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We enjoyed everything about the pink house! It’s comfortable and has a wonderful location for a Seagrove/ Seaside beach vacation! Catherine was an amazing host and the house was stocked with even the smallest details. We were grateful for the details and comfort the pink house provided so we could spend more time relaxing and planning the next adventure!",
